There is no way at all that this character is too messed up and weak
to progress.  Just take it slow and don't panic.  David has told you
how to handle the chickatrice.  Even though the Samurai is "supposed"
to be a combat wombat don't be ashamed, if the circumstances dictate,
to adopt a different strategy temporarily.  Concerned about your AC?
Write "Elbereth" a lot and let your pet take care of monsters until
you find better armor.  Soon enough a shop will turn up (you can
always use the one in Minetown if you have to) and you'll be able to
price-ID your items.  It may only take one more found item to bust
your game wide open.  Right now, for instance, I have a valkyrie that
has found a touchstone on level 2, and I think I'm going to do the
protection racket with her because that fits what the RGN has brought
me.


